{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">藝人葉蒨文（Sophie）與曾展望（GM）近年人氣高企，憑《女神配對計劃》等節目深受觀眾喜愛。近日二人在廣州舉行1周年粉絲見面會，吸引大批粉絲到場支持。雖然活動當日適逢香港吹9號風球，但仍無阻一班忠實粉絲排除萬難包車跨境赴會，讓 Sophie 與 GM 感動不已！</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"35752db2-20bb-4053-a7e1-28f72ed6edb6.jpeg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/20265Mr2zyhvII1785220649.jpeg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"35752db2-20bb-4053-a7e1-28f72ed6edb6.jpeg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">為了照顧內地及跨地區的粉絲，Sophie 與 GM 特意將見面會地點定於廣州。豈料活動當天香港遇上極端天氣，天文台更發出9號風球訊號，不少香港粉絲的行程嚴重受阻。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Sophie 接受tvb.com獨家訪問時，坦言當時十分緊張：「因為今次見面會想照顧埋內地嘅粉絲，所以就揀咗喺廣州進行。點知香港咁啱落起9號風球，粉絲佢哋經過重重困難包車上廣州。一開始架車根本開唔到，但佢哋最後排除萬難，雖然遲咗少少到，但都順利開始。」她更深情向粉絲告白：<strong>「我哋仲話：『GPS，我哋打風都打唔甩！』🥰」</strong></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3eccff3c-3b24-4946-9029-f065ab9687ed.jpeg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/202650iYFGXuUP1785220649.jpeg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3eccff3c-3b24-4946-9029-f065ab9687ed.jpeg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">見面會現場佈置相當用心，粉絲準備了二人專屬的宣傳橫額及打卡位。Sophie 與 GM 亦非常親民，現場大擺心心甫士、親密翹手供大家拍照，並與粉絲玩成一片。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">為了答謝粉絲一年來的支持，二人特別安排了「粉絲許願環節」。得知粉絲想看二人合體跳舞，Sophie 與 GM 毫不吝嗇，現場大玩跳舞遊戲，大派甜蜜「粉絲福利」，引起全場尖叫聲不斷！</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"c7b38180-8e09-4afd-bc97-eb82780c4bfb.jpeg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026wXfVSy7Pwv1785220649.jpeg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"c7b38180-8e09-4afd-bc97-eb82780c4bfb.jpeg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"a543e25b-7300-4247-aa4e-1991e298208d.jpeg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026kMWg17sdtM1785220649.jpeg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"a543e25b-7300-4247-aa4e-1991e298208d.jpeg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"4af491a7-9fb9-42e9-8f02-635a6c8497e2.jpeg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026EbriCTI4aY1785220648.jpeg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"4af491a7-9fb9-42e9-8f02-635a6c8497e2.jpeg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"26ae483a-755b-4dbd-8382-3d58e58aa15b.jpeg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026kU6G0eHfKr1785220649.jpeg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"26ae483a-755b-4dbd-8382-3d58e58aa15b.jpeg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"49e4f37f-4391-49c3-8e05-406f2380c220.jpeg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026FsdURvK94q1785220649.jpeg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"49e4f37f-4391-49c3-8e05-406f2380c220.jpeg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-28T08:20:18.244095+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":543,"images":7,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}